      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your emotions and concerns are valid, and it's crucial to acknowledge them. It can feel unfair, but you're already being a support by communicating. Maybe we can explore options together to Bestow comfort on the people you care about and help mend existing relationships. Remember, it's important to take care of your mental health first. Taking small steps can make a difference, and you're not alone in this.",
